    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide</a></i></p><p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>Your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Rapid_Strike\" title=\"Rapid Strike\">Rapid Strike</a> is more effective with Light Melee Weapons.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Rapid_Strike\" title=\"Rapid Strike\">Rapid Strike</a></p><p><b>Effect:</b> When using a Light Melee Weapon or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsaber\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lightsaber\">Lightsaber</a> with the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Rapid_Strike\" title=\"Rapid Strike\">Rapid Strike</a> Feat, you can take a -5 penalty to your attack roll to gain +2 dice of damage on a successful strike.</p><p><b>Special:</b> This does not stack with the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Rapid_Strike\" title=\"Rapid Strike\">Rapid Strike</a> Feat or extra damage provided by any source that does not stack with the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Rapid_Strike\" title=\"Rapid Strike\">Rapid Strike</a> Feat (such as <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Mighty_Swing\" title=\"Mighty Swing\">Mighty Swing</a>). If you do not have a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> of 13 or higher, the penalty to your attack roll is -10 instead of -5.</p>",
